## Door
@narrator{code="0010"}: Someone knocks.
<branch id="knock" prompt="Open the door?" timeout="5" default="wait">
  <choice id="open" text="Open it">
    ::set{run.answered = "open"}
    @narrator{code="0020"}: You open the door.
  </choice>
  <choice id="wait" text="Wait">
    ::set{run.answered = "wait"}
    @narrator{code="0030"}: The knocking stops.
  </choice>
</branch>
@narrator{code="0040"}: The hall is quiet.
